<title>JAPAN: Kawasaki Steel Cont - 6mth parent results.</title>
<headline>Kawasaki Steel Cont - 6mth parent results.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-11-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to September 30, 1996</p>
<p> (Parent)	(in billions of yen unless specified)</p>
<p> Sales		  9.68		vs	   10.03</p>
<p> Operating	  449    million    vs	  591    million</p>
<p> Current	    422    million    vs	  551    million</p>
<p> Net		  234    million    vs	  320    million</p>
<p> EPS		   12.54 yen	  vs	   17.15 yen</p>
<p> Shares	     19 million	  vs	  19 million</p>
<p> Interim div	  3.50 yen	  vs	    3.50 yen</p>
<p>NOTE - Kawasaki Steel Container Co Ltd is a maker of industrial containers.</p>
</text>
